    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">String parsing</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/valid-word-abbreviation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 408</a> <span class=\"chip warn\">Premium</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Valid Word Abbreviation</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Walk the word and the abbreviation with one pointer each: a letter must match, a number jumps the word pointer forward. Reject a leading <code>0</code>, and answer true only if both pointers land exactly at their ends. O(n + m) time, O(1) space; a Meta phone-screen regular.</p>\n"
